  "fourDistinctShapes": true,
  "cancelProtocolObserved": true,
  "caveat": "Two hang lengths (120s, 5s) against toolCallTimeoutMs 3000. The late reply arrived after the client had already failed the call, so whether it is ever consumed was not tested. The child in the 120s run was terminated with the run, not necessarily by the client."
